ivide-gray-200 xl:dark:divide-gray-700\"><header class=\"pt-6 xl:pb-6\"><div class=\"space-y-1 text-center\"><dl class=\"space-y-10\"><div><dt class=\"sr-only\">Published on</dt><dd class=\"text-base leading-6 font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\"><time dateTime=\"2010-06-10T00:00:00.000Z\">Thursday, June 10, 2010</time></dd></div></dl><div><h1 class=\"text-3xl leading-9 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl sm:leading-10 md:text-5xl md:leading-14 dark:text-gray-100\">WOW Recruitment Widget 1.1</h1></div></div></header><div class=\"grid-rows-[auto_1fr] divide-y divide-gray-200 pb-8 xl:grid xl:grid-cols-4 xl:gap-x-6 xl:divide-y-0 dark:divide-gray-700\"><dl class=\"pt-6 pb-10 xl:border-b xl:border-gray-200 xl:pt-11 xl:dark:border-gray-700\"><dt class=\"sr-only\">Authors</dt><dd><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 sm:space-x-12 xl:block xl:space-y-8 xl:space-x-0\"><li class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\"><img alt=\"avatar\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-10 rounded-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Favatars.githubusercontent.com%2Fu%2F571652%3Fv%3D4&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Favatars.githubusercontent.com%2Fu%2F571652%3Fv%3D4&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Favatars.githubusercontent.com%2Fu%2F571652%3Fv%3D4&amp;w=96&amp;q=75\"/><dl class=\"text-sm leading-5 font-medium whitespace-nowrap\"><dt class=\"sr-only\">Name</dt><dd class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100\">Freeman Man</dd><dt class=\"sr-only\">Twitter</dt><dd></dd></dl></li></ul></dd></dl><div class=\"divide-y divide-gray-200 xl:col-span-3 xl:row-span-2 xl:pb-0 dark:divide-gray-700\"><div class=\"prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none pt-10 pb-8\"><div><p>for more information about this plugin please go to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/wow-recruit-widget/\">wordpress plugin gallery</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>current stable release 1.1.4</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>****please save the widget once after upgrading from 1.0.x to make data work with new codes</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The 1.1.3 admin panel bug only happened to Internet Explorer due to an incomplete html tag (IE hides contents inside while all other browsers show contents inside), so if you are using Internet Explorer, please update to 1.1.4 to fix this bug.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Update 24/6/2010: eh…. took me ages to find the bug… turns out it is only missing a close “&gt;” so the drop down box breaks in certain browsers, namely, freaking Internet Explorer, come on, stop using IE guys! anyway, 1.1.4 released, enjoy.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Update 23/6/2010: looks like there can be a bug on admin form on some servers, if you have problem using 1.1.x just revert back to 1.0.1 at the mean time. I’ll upload a beta version to this page these few days, please stay tuned with this post thanks!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Update 19/6/2010: fixed a bug that may cause by css float</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Update 19/6/2010: fixed a typo “Huner” and released 1.1.2 lol, also fixed some subversion stuffs, now it won’t give you dead images if you need to revert to older versions.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Update 18/6/2010: turns out there’s really some bug on sorting algorithm also does not quite work on multi-site, I’ve fixed and released 1.1.1, it should work fine now, please comment here it doesn’t work on your site <!-- -->😄</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Update 16/6/2010: er … the sorting algorithm is still buggy, I’ll look into it again in the next update.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Description</p>\n<p>This version is updated to work with 3.0 single and multi site <!-- -->😄</p>\n<p>I’ve revamped the whole widget and did a lot of changes to old codes, it should be way much cleaner than before.</p>\n<p><strong>New Features in 1.1:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>no more old school table layout, all are recoded with css2 (works on IE8 as well)</li>\n<li>since there is no more layout codes in the widget itself, custom layout can be done just by editing the css</li>\n<li>color and layout are seperated into 2 css files</li>\n<li>data structure is changed, old data will be changed to new structure automatically</li>\n<li>class icons are combined into css sprite</li>\n<li>new sorting method used, it should sort by status then class as intended now.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>** row order in widget settings does not affect order that displays in front, it will just automatically sorts by status then class, I will improve this in future version</p>\n<p><strong>Thank you for all your support, stay tuned for updates~</strong></p>\n<p>Download from wordpress plugin gallery:�<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/wow-recruit-widget/\">http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/wow-recruit-widget/</a></p>\n<p>Full change log, plugin description after the break.</p>\n<p>Changelog</p>\n<p>= 1.1 =<br/>\n<!-- -->* major recode to everything including data structure<br/>\n<!-- -->* no more table layout, all replaced by div, which can be easily customized by editing css/layout.css<br/>\n<!-- -->* color and layout are seperated into css/layout.css and css/color.css<br/>\n<!-- -->* class icons are combined into css sprite<br/>\n<!-- -->* new sorting method used, it should sort by status then class as intended now<br/>\n<!-- -->= 1.1.1 =<br/>\n<!-- -->* fixed a few non-set variable and duplicate function declaration bug, thanks Ramides<br/>\n<!-- -->* fixed sorting mechanism, it should sort by status from high to low, then by class in alphabetical order, tell me if it is still bugged<br/>\n<!-- -->= 1.1.2 =<br/>\n<!-- -->* fixed a typing mistake “Huner”, lol, thanks KGBAgent<br/>\n<!-- -->= 1.1.3 =<br/>\n<!-- -->* fixed a layout bug that may cause by css float<br/>\n<!-- -->= 1.1.4 =<br/>\n<!-- -->* fixed a lovely IE only bug, thanks KGBAgent again</p>\n<p>F